    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Why Guests Love Seaside Vibes<br><br>⭐ Private Pool with Waterfall<br>⭐ Walk or Bike to Seaside<br>⭐ 6-Passenger Golf Cart Included<br>⭐ 6 Beach Cruiser Bikes Included<br>⭐ Elevator for Easy Access to All Floors<br>⭐ Two Full Kitchens + Kitchenette<br>⭐ Multiple Living Areas for Large Groups<br>⭐ Sleeps up to 20 Guests Comfortably<br><br>Large homes this close to Seaside with these amenities are rare on 30A.<br><br>Welcome to Seaside Vibes, a luxury 30A retreat just minutes from Seaside and the sugar-white beaches of the Emerald Coast.<br><br>Perfect for large family vacations, reunions, and group getaways, this stunning 6-bedroom, 3-story home comfortably sleeps up to 20 guests and features everything you need for the ultimate beach escape — including a private pool, golf cart, bikes, elevator, and multiple living spaces designed for gathering and relaxing.<br><br>Spend your mornings biking to Seaside for coffee, your afternoons at the beach, and your evenings relaxing by the pool with family and friends.<br><br>This is the kind of beach house where vacation memories are made.<br><br>⸻<br><br>The Experience<br><br>Seaside Vibes was designed for groups who want space, comfort, and an unbeatable 30A location.<br><br>With three floors of living space, two kitchens, and two spacious living rooms, everyone can spread out while still enjoying time together.<br><br>Large windows fill the home with natural light, and the open living areas create the perfect setting for game nights, group dinners, and relaxing after a day at the beach.<br><br>Outside, the private pool patio becomes the heart of the home — perfect for cooling off, enjoying evening drinks, or letting the kids splash while the adults unwind.<br><br><br>Home Layout (Sleeps 20)<br><br>Designed for multi-family trips and large groups.<br><br>First Floor<br><br>• King bedroom<br>• Queen bedroom<br>• Living room<br>• Kitchenette<br>• Pool access<br><br>Second Floor<br><br>• King bedroom<br>• Double queen bedroom<br>• Main living room<br>• Chef’s kitchen<br>• Dining area<br><br>Third Floor<br><br>• Primary king suite<br>• Bunk room with four twin bunks (sleeps 8)<br>• Kitchenette<br>• Balcony seating<br><br>⸻<br><br>Outdoor Living<br><br>Step outside and enjoy your private backyard oasis.<br><br>The pool area is perfect for relaxing after a day exploring 30A, and the outdoor seating makes it easy to enjoy warm Florida evenings with family and friends.<br><br>Grill dinner, take a dip in the pool, or simply unwind under the coastal sky.<br><br>⸻<br><br>Explore Seaside & Scenic 30A<br><br>One of the best parts of staying at Seaside Vibes is the incredible location.<br><br>Within minutes you can enjoy:<br><br>• Seaside Town Square<br>• Iconic food trucks and restaurants<br>• Boutique shopping<br>• Seaside Amphitheater events<br>• Scenic 30A bike path<br>• Some of the most beautiful beaches in the country<br><br>Grab the bikes or hop on the golf cart and explore everything that makes 30A one of America’s favorite beach destinations.<br><br>⸻<br><br>Perfect For<br><br>Seaside Vibes is ideal for:<br><br>• Multi-family vacations<br>• Family reunions<br>• Girls trips<br>• Wedding groups<br>• Milestone celebrations<br>• Beach getaways with friends<br><br>⸻<br><br>Things to Know<br><br>• Golf cart included<br>• Bikes included<br>• Pool heat available (seasonal)<br><br>⸻<br><br><br>Luxury homes near Seaside that sleep 20 and include a private pool, golf cart, bikes, and elevator are extremely limited — and they book quickly.<br><br>If you’re planning a large group vacation on 30A, Seaside Vibes delivers the perfect combination of space, comfort, and location.<br><br>Book your stay today and experience the best of the Emerald Coast.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
